294	V2 (definition-first) & 32 & 0.564 & $-$0.648 & 0.043 \\
295	Instruction-rewrite & 8 & 0.847 & $-$0.223 & 0.536 \\
296	Instruction-rewrite & 32 & 0.662 & $-$0.469 & 0.171 \\
