Head entity: "{head_entity}"
Tail entity: "{tail_entity}"

Candidate relations: {type_1}, {type_2}, ...

Output a single JSON object:
  {"relation": "<relation_type>"}
If none of the candidate relations apply, output:
  {"relation": "none"}
\end{lstlisting}
\end{small}

